WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.352
Introducing ViDiHand V2.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.353
Watch what happens when we move beyond the image.

00:00:09.353 --> 00:00:11.288
The depth becomes clear.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Our reconstruction follows the reference through the motion,

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.688
with lower three D error.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.081
This is ViDiHand V2,

00:00:26.081 --> 00:00:28.308
built for the real world.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:34.678
The same model works across all four in-the-wild datasets,

00:00:34.678 --> 00:00:37.596
capturing hands as everyday life unfolds.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.227
On GenHumanEgo,

00:00:57.227 --> 00:01:01.336
just thirty two point six millimeters of error.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.290
We keep hands in sight,

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:07.356
with over ninety nine percent frame accuracy.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.270
The motion stays steady too,

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.308
with the lowest jitter in this comparison.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.513
ViDiHand V2.

00:01:26.513 --> 00:01:30.044
Let's bring 3D to life.
